flowchart TB
    subgraph Capture[Meeting input]
        Manual[Manual notes and text upload - current]
        ZoomFile[Zoom transcript upload - planned]
        ZoomAPI[Direct Zoom connector - future]
    end
    subgraph Entry[User and assistant entry points]
        Web[Web workspace - current local demo]
        API[Application API - current local routes]
        MCP[MCP facade - future and optional]
        Client[Approved assistant client - future]
        Web --> API
        Client --> MCP
    end
    Manual --> Web
    ZoomFile --> Web
    ZoomAPI --> Intake
    API --> Core
    MCP --> Core
    subgraph Service[Shared application services]
        Core[Project and workflow service]
        Intake[Normalize transcript and preserve source - planned]
        Extract[Extract candidate decisions and actions - planned]
        Confirm[User confirms meeting understanding - planned]
        History[Meeting snapshots and explicit progress - current]
        RAG[Glossary and lexical retrieval - current with fixtures]
        Evidence[User confirms definitions and evidence - current]
        Draft[Versioned templates and draft generation - current]
        Review[Edit and approve revision - current]
        Publish[Publication adapters and ledger - live version planned]
        Core --> Intake --> Extract --> Confirm --> History
        Core --> History
        History --> RAG --> Evidence --> Draft --> Review --> Publish
    end
    subgraph Knowledge[Business context and delivery sources]
        Fixture[Fictional Confluence index - current]
        Confluence[Live Confluence REST adapter - future]
        Jira[Jira issue and status adapter - future]
        SharePoint[Selected template library - future]
        Sync[Permission-aware incremental sync - future]
        Fixture --> RAG
        Confluence --> Sync
        Jira --> Sync
        SharePoint --> Sync
        Sync --> RAG
    end
    subgraph Generation[Generation options]
        Offline[Deterministic sample - current]
        Copilot[Manual Copilot brief and JSON import - current]
        SDK[Approved Copilot SDK integration - future evaluation]
    end
    Draft <--> Offline
    Draft <--> Copilot
    Draft <--> SDK
    subgraph Outputs[Reviewed outputs]
        Word[Word document - current]
        LocalPage[Confluence simulation - current]
        LivePage[Create or update Confluence page - future]
        JiraWrite[Reviewed Jira changes - future]
        PPT[Existing organizational PPT agent - future adapter]
        Review --> Word
        Publish --> LocalPage
        Publish --> LivePage
        Publish --> JiraWrite
        Publish --> PPT
    end
    subgraph Shared[Cross-cutting production services - future]
        Auth[SSO and project membership]
        Access[Source and destination authorization]
        Jobs[Durable jobs and bounded retries]
        Ledger[Artifact versions and source dependencies]
        Secrets[Credential store and operational audit]
    end
    Shared -.-> Service
    LivePage -. refresh affected evidence .-> Sync
